# A permanent that leaves the battlefield and returns is a new object with a new timestamp (CR 400.7, 613.7d), which
# turns the ruling of Opalescence and Humility round. Humility (turn 1) is earlier than Opalescence (turn 3), so in layer
# 7b Humility's 1/1 applies first and Opalescence's 4/4 after it: Humility is a 4/4 creature. On turn 5 Bot1 casts
# Ephemerate on it (a creature it controls): it is exiled and returns, now later than Opalescence, and is 1/1.

